SUMMARY="The command line of OxygenHub, the forge for Oxygen repositories"
DESCRIPTION="oh talks to an OxygenHub (such as https://oxygenhub.io): issues, proposals \
and their reviews, releases, Flow runs, their logs and reports, and checks, \
from the terminal. It works alongside oxy, the Oxygen version control \
client."
HOMEPAGE="https://oxygenhub.io/andymccall/oxygenhub"
COPYRIGHT="2026 Andy McCall"
LICENSE="MIT
	Apache v2"
